aivas (0.1.1-1~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix: web chat rate-limit cascade — orphan user messages stripped from
    history before replay to prevent consecutive-user-message 400 errors.
  * Fix: Phase B streaming now uses Mistral when Phase A fell back to it;
    fallback is now end-to-end, not routing-only.
  * Fix: save_user() moved after agent 'done' event (mirrors TUI pattern)
    so failed turns never leave dangling messages in the DB.
  * Fix: network (CIDR) scans use QUICK_SCRIPTS to avoid ssl-enum-ciphers
    host-timeout killing scan results on multi-host sweeps.
  * Fix: PDF download uses <a download> instead of window.open() to bypass
    browser popup blockers.
  * Fix: Windows-1252 mojibake (â€") corrected to proper Unicode in the
    web chat renderer.
  * Fix: Shodan API key now correctly passed through to the web chat handler.
  * Fix: AI agent no longer invents SSH credentials when scanning saved targets.

